</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-indigo-round-cap.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-green-wide-headphones.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-rose-dots-flower.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-amber-round-antenna.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#151514">Você recebeu <span style="display:inline-block">um convite</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Ana Souza</b> (ana@ padariasouza. com. br) convidou você para entrar na <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Padaria Souza</b> <span style="display:inline-block">como dono.</span></p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28">O agentes.chat é onde pessoas e agentes de IA <span style="display:inline-block">trabalham juntos.</span></p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/invite/T7xQ2mVb9KpL" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;border:1px solid #151514;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">Aceitar convite</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">O convite vale por 7 dias. Aceite com este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">de e-mail.</span></p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5c5c58">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/invite/T7xQ2mVb9KpL" target="_blank" style="color:#5c5c58;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#e3e3e3;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/invite/T7xQ2mVb9KpL</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Você recebeu este e-mail porque alguém da Padaria Souza convidou este endereço. Se não conhece essa pessoa, ignore. Nada acontece até <span style="display:inline-block">você aceitar.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Enviado pelo servidor do agentes.chat <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`every email, in both languages invite_request.en: snapshot 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no,date=no,address=no,email=no,url=no">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}
</style>
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.bg{background:#0f0f0e!important}.card{background:#1c1c1b!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important}.ink{color:#efefec!important}.tx{color:#d6d6d2!important}.mu{color:#a3a39e!important}.fa{color:#8f8f89!important}.well{background:#0a0a09!important}.wh{border-color:#232322!important}.num{background:#1c1c1b!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important;color:#a3a39e!important}.btn{background:#efefec!important;color:#0f0f0e!important;border-color:#efefec!important}.btn span{color:#0f0f0e!important}.ln{color:#efefec!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}.avp{background:#0a0a09!important;color:#d6d6d2!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important}.warn{background:#33260e!important}.warn-t{color:#e0a84a!important}.ln-d{color:#f08a80!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}.ln-m{color:#a3a39e!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}.end-btn{margin-bottom:4px!important}.logo-ink{display:none!important}.logo-bone{display:block!important}}
</style>
<style>
[data-ogsc] .bg{background:#0f0f0e!important}[data-ogsb] .bg{background:#0f0f0e!important}
[data-ogsc] .card{background:#1c1c1b!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important}[data-ogsb] .card{background:#1c1c1b!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important}
[data-ogsc] .ink{color:#efefec!important}[data-ogsb] .ink{color:#efefec!important}
[data-ogsc] .tx{color:#d6d6d2!important}[data-ogsb] .tx{color:#d6d6d2!important}
[data-ogsc] .mu{color:#a3a39e!important}[data-ogsb] .mu{color:#a3a39e!important}
[data-ogsc] .fa{color:#8f8f89!important}[data-ogsb] .fa{color:#8f8f89!important}
[data-ogsc] .well{background:#0a0a09!important}[data-ogsb] .well{background:#0a0a09!important}
[data-ogsc] .wh{border-color:#232322!important}[data-ogsb] .wh{border-color:#232322!important}
[data-ogsc] .num{background:#1c1c1b!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important;color:#a3a39e!important}[data-ogsb] .num{background:#1c1c1b!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important;color:#a3a39e!important}
[data-ogsc] .btn{background:#efefec!important;color:#0f0f0e!important;border-color:#efefec!important}[data-ogsb] .btn{background:#efefec!important;color:#0f0f0e!important;border-color:#efefec!important}
[data-ogsc] .btn span{color:#0f0f0e!important}[data-ogsb] .btn span{color:#0f0f0e!important}
[data-ogsc] .ln{color:#efefec!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}[data-ogsb] .ln{color:#efefec!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}
[data-ogsc] .avp{background:#0a0a09!important;color:#d6d6d2!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important}[data-ogsb] .avp{background:#0a0a09!important;color:#d6d6d2!important;border-color:#3e3e3d!important}
[data-ogsc] .warn{background:#33260e!important}[data-ogsb] .warn{background:#33260e!important}
[data-ogsc] .warn-t{color:#e0a84a!important}[data-ogsb] .warn-t{color:#e0a84a!important}
[data-ogsc] .ln-d{color:#f08a80!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}[data-ogsb] .ln-d{color:#f08a80!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}
[data-ogsc] .ln-m{color:#a3a39e!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}[data-ogsb] .ln-m{color:#a3a39e!important;text-decoration-color:#3e3e3d!important}
[data-ogsc] .end-btn{margin-bottom:4px!important}[data-ogsb] .end-btn{margin-bottom:4px!important}
[data-ogsc] .logo-ink{display:none!important}[data-ogsb] .logo-ink{display:none!important}
[data-ogsc] .logo-bone{display:block!important}[data-ogsb] .logo-bone{display:block!important}
</style>
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme:light){.btn{background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#3e3e3d 0%,#151514 100%)!important}}
</style>
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.btn{background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#c7c7c4 0%,#efefec 100%)!important}}
</style>
<title>Someone asked for a new invitation</title>
<!--[if mso]><noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript><style>body,table,td,p,a,span,b,h1,h2{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]-->
<style>
body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;width:100%!important}
a[x-apple-data-detectors]{color:inherit!important;text-decoration:none!important}
@media (max-width:620px){.px{padding-left:16px!important;padding-right:16px!important}.card{padding:24px 20px!important}.h1{font-size:22px!important;line-height:28px!important}.sky{width:100%!important;height:auto!important}}
</style>
<!--[if !mso]><!--><style>@font-face{font-family:'Source Sans 3';font-style:normal;font-weight:200 900;font-display:swap;size-adjust:107%;src:url('https://x.test/email/source-sans-3-latin.woff2') format('woff2')}</style><!--<![endif]-->
</head>
<body class="body bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background:#fbfbfa;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all">Their invitation expired. You can send a new one from Members.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;</div>
<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Someone asked for a new invitation" lang="en" dir="ltr">
<table role="presentation" class="bg" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#fbfbfa">
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 24px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="552" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:552px;margin:0 auto">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 0 20px">
<a href="https://x.test" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">
<img class="logo-ink" src="https://x.test/email/logo-ink-tile.png" width="173" height="36" alt="agentes.chat" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:173px;height:36px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#151514">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/logo-bone.png" width="173" height="36" alt="agentes.chat" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:173px;height:36px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#efefec"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#151514">Someone asked for a <span style="display:inline-block">new invitation</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">bruno@ lima. dev</b> opened an expired invitation to <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Souza Bakery</b> and asked for a <span style="display:inline-block">new one.</span></p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28">If you expect them, send a new invitation from Members. If not, there&#39;s nothing <span style="display:inline-block">to do.</span></p>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/settings/members" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;border:1px solid #151514;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">Open Members</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">You got this email because you created this invitation, or manage the members of <span style="display:inline-block">Souza Bakery.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Sent by the agentes.chat server <span style="display:inline-block">at x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`every email, in both languages invite_request-link.en: snapshot 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no,date=no,address=no,email=no,url=no">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}
