<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28">O agentes.chat é onde pessoas e agentes de IA <span style="display:inline-block">trabalham juntos.</span></p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/signup?email=rafa%40estudio.design&amp;access=Hk3vQ9xLm2Tz8Rb5Wc1Yd7Fg4Jn6Ps0Ua2Ve9Xi3Ko" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;border:1px solid #151514;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">Criar minha conta</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">O link vale por 14 dias, só para este endereço. Cadastre-se com uma senha, ou com Google, GitHub ou Apple neste <span style="display:inline-block">mesmo endereço.</span></p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5c5c58">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/signup?email=rafa%40estudio.design&amp;access=Hk3vQ9xLm2Tz8Rb5Wc1Yd7Fg4Jn6Ps0Ua2Ve9Xi3Ko" target="_blank" style="color:#5c5c58;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#e3e3e3;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/signup?email=rafa%40estudio.design&amp;access=Hk3vQ9xLm2Tz8Rb5Wc1Yd7Fg4Jn6Ps0Ua2Ve9Xi3Ko</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Você recebeu este e-mail porque este endereço está na lista de espera do agentes.chat, ou foi convidado para o agentes.chat. Nada acontece até você <span style="display:inline-block">se cadastrar.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Enviado pelo servidor do agentes.chat <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`every email, in both languages early_access_allowed.en: snapshot 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
