<title>Alguém pede para entrar no seu workspace</title>
<!--[if mso]><noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript><style>body,table,td,p,a,span,b,h1,h2{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]-->
<style>
body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;width:100%!important}
a[x-apple-data-detectors]{color:inherit!important;text-decoration:none!important}
@media (max-width:620px){.px{padding-left:16px!important;padding-right:16px!important}.card{padding:24px 20px!important}.h1{font-size:22px!important;line-height:28px!important}.sky{width:100%!important;height:auto!important}}
</style>
<!--[if !mso]><!--><style>@font-face{font-family:'Source Sans 3';font-style:normal;font-weight:200 900;font-display:swap;size-adjust:107%;src:url('https://x.test/email/source-sans-3-latin.woff2') format('woff2')}</style><!--<![endif]-->
</head>
<body class="body bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background:#fbfbfa;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all">Aprove ou recuse em Membros. Nada acontece até você responder.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;</div>
<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Alguém pede para entrar no seu workspace" lang="pt-BR" dir="ltr">
<table role="presentation" class="bg" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#fbfbfa">
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 24px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="552" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:552px;margin:0 auto">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 0 20px">
<a href="https://x.test" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">
<img class="logo-ink" src="https://x.test/email/logo-ink-tile.png" width="173" height="36" alt="agentes.chat" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:173px;height:36px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#151514">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/logo-bone.png" width="173" height="36" alt="agentes.chat" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:173px;height:36px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#efefec"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#151514">Um pedido para entrar espera <span style="display:inline-block">por você</span></h1>
<table width="100%" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 8px"><tr>
<td width="44" valign="top" style="width:44px;padding:5px 0 12px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="avp" width="30" height="30" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:30px;height:30px;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f3f0;color:#2a2a28;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700">AS</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 12px">
<p class="ink" style="margin:0;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#151514">Ana Souza</p><p class="mu" style="margin:0;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58"><a class="ln-m" href="mailto:ana@estudio.com" style="color:#5c5c58;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#e3e3e3;text-underline-offset:3px">ana@estudio.com</a></p></td>
</tr></table>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28">Essa pessoa abriu o link de convite da <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Estúdio Alves</b> e pediu <span style="display:inline-block">para entrar.</span></p>
<table width="100%" class="well" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f3f3f0;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 16px"><tr>
<td class="tx" style="padding:14px 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#2a2a28">Aprove só quem você espera. A pessoa entra como membro, a não ser que você escolha outro papel <span style="display:inline-block">na página.</span></td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/settings/members?request=jr_7&amp;do=approve" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;border:1px solid #151514;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">Aprovar</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a><span style="display:inline-block;width:16px;font-size:15px;line-height:20px">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a class="ln-d" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/settings/members?request=jr_7&amp;do=deny" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 0;color:#b42a20;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#e3e3e3;text-underline-offset:3px;text-underline-color:#e3e3e3"><span style="mso-text-raise:93%">Recusar</span></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">Todos os pedidos <span style="display:inline-block">em espera estão em Membros.</span></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Você recebeu este e-mail porque é dono ou admin da Estúdio Alves. É enviado no máximo uma vez <span style="display:inline-block">por hora.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Enviado pelo servidor do agentes.chat <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
