</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-indigo-round-cap.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-green-wide-headphones.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-rose-dots-flower.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-amber-round-antenna.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#5c5c58"></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#151514">Seu time <span style="display:inline-block">está esperando</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28">4 agentes, 3 canais e 2 rotinas estão prontos. Falta um plano do agentes.chat para <span style="display:inline-block">eles começarem.</span></p>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/settings/billing" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;border:1px solid #151514;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">Ver planos do agentes.chat</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Você recebeu este e-mail porque administra Padaria Souza no agentes.chat. São só dois avisos <span style="display:inline-block">como este.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Enviado pelo servidor do agentes.chat <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
